u003eJune 16, 2015 at 12:14 AM\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"icon-comments\" style=\"font-family: FontAwesome; text-decoration: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline; width: auto; height: auto; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(185, 185, 185); padding: 0px 2px 0px 10px; background-position: 0% 0%; background-repeat: repeat repeat;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/replies/199145\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003e0 replies\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"icon-reply\" style=\"font-family: FontAwesome; text-decoration: inherit; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline; width: auto; height: auto; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: none; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(185, 185, 185); padding: 0px 2px 0px 10px; background-position: 0% 0%; background-repeat: repeat repeat;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://avicus.net/forums/replies/new?reply_id=199145\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eReply\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width: 836.59375px; padding-top: 15px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"span12\" style=\"float: left; min-height: 1px; margin-left: 0px; width: 836.59375px; box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"post-head\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eHello,\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eYou have received 19 previous infractions before this ban, including 2-3 tempbans for the very same reason. Within days after being unbanned countless times, you were still caught breaking the rules. Unfortunately, you won't be given another chance.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eRegards,\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eDutchis, Avicus Network Administrator.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eis the message I received from my former appeal. I would like to point out some of my evidence from using this. \u0026nbsp;\"\u003ci\u003eUnfortunately, you won't be given another chance.\"is what they say about hacking.\u003c/i\u003e Ok 2 chances with hacking (which i don't do) What about the moderator MLGPorky that banned me before. He hacked. I checked last night but his infractions were reset. I remember seeing at least three hacking bans. OK Lets give a hacker administrator powers. Oh and while were at it lets sell Obama to Isis.\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003eWithin days after being \u003cb\u003eunbanned.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c/b\u003eI have never been unbanned. I have been given a temp ban and it ran out but that's different. It can be an understanding that gets people banned. For example when Porky banned me i had holes in the wall around spawn. He didnt see them. Just like last match I thought he was trying to grief me. So i broke the blocks and he fell in. So I'm also sorry for breaking the rules ayer timbals. I just get excited and get warned kicked or \u0026nbsp;temp banned for caps. I only do that because I love this server so Dutchis if you need be like that then ok but I would still love to be a part of the Avicus Commnity. Thank you for these good memories here and hopefully not goodbye to Nebula!\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp; -Pockets\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eP.S. To the guy i killed: I'm Sorry!\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv class=\"reply258478\" id=\"reply199145\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cd