 Let's review:\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- You've got 2 infractions for swearing.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 7 infractions for caps/excessive caps.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 2 more infractions for rudeness.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 3 for spam.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- A total of 3 more for Scam, report abuse, and public hack accusations.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;And to top everything off, you've got a Temp ban, and now a PermBan for excessive infractions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;Correct me if I'm wrong, but you didn't learn, you kept breaking rules, and you certainly didn't stop, thus I'm truly sorry, however your punishment will remain valid.\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for your time and effort.","body_tagged":"Hello, \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;No need for the aggressive approach, the punishments you have been given are valid. Let's review:\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- You've got 2 infractions for swearing.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 7 infractions for caps/excessive caps.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 2 more infractions for rudeness.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- 3 for spam.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;- A total of 3 more for Scam, report abuse, and public hack accusations.\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;And to top everything off, you've got a Temp ban, and now a PermBan for excessive infractions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;Correct me if I'm wrong, but you didn't learn, you kept breaking rules, and you certainly didn't stop, thus I'm truly sorry, however your punishment will remain valid.\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThank you for your time and effort.","created_at":1434718342}]}